{"seq":1,"slug":"engagement-metrics","title":"参与与表现指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-analytics/methods/engagement-metrics","wordCount":1489,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"参与与表现指标\">参与与表现指标</h1><p>一条原始日志长这样：<code>user=8821, event=video_pause, ts=1719742013, position=412s</code>。它本身毫无意义。把成千上万条这样的事件压缩成「该生本周视频完成率 67%」，才让人能读、能比、能行动。这个压缩过程就是指标工程，它是学习分析从数据走向决策的第一道、也是最容易出错的关口——一个定义草率的「参与度」，会让上层所有模型与仪表盘集体失真。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从原始事件到可行动指标的三级提炼\">核心概念：从原始事件到可行动指标的三级提炼</h2><p>指标不是凭空定义的，而是沿着「事件→度量→合成指标」的管道逐级提炼。每升一级，可读性增加，但也丢失信息、引入假设，因此每一级都要回答「这个简化是否扭曲了我想度量的东西」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[原始事件流&lt;br/&gt;点击/暂停/提交] --&gt; B[基础度量&lt;br/&gt;计数/时长/频次]&#10;  B --&gt; C[参与指标&lt;br/&gt;活跃天数/完成率]&#10;  B --&gt; D[表现指标&lt;br/&gt;正确率/掌握度]&#10;  C --&gt; E[合成指标&lt;br/&gt;加权参与分]&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[决策&lt;br/&gt;预警/个性化/仪表盘]\">flowchart TD\n  A[原始事件流&lt;br/&gt;点击/暂停/提交] --&gt; B[基础度量&lt;br/&gt;计数/时长/频次]\n  B --&gt; C[参与指标&lt;br/&gt;活跃天数/完成率]\n  B --&gt; D[表现指标&lt;br/&gt;正确率/掌握度]\n  C --&gt; E[合成指标&lt;br/&gt;加权参与分]\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[决策&lt;br/&gt;预警/个性化/仪表盘]</pre><p>这条管道直接喂给三类应用：合成参与分驱动 <a href=\"../applications/early-warning-dropout\">风险预警与辍学预测</a>，表现指标驱动 <a href=\"../applications/adaptive-personalization\">自适应与个性化</a>，而几乎所有指标最终都要呈现在 <a href=\"../applications/analytics-dashboards\">学习仪表盘</a> 上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参与指标-度量-投入了多少\">参与指标：度量「投入了多少」</h2><p>参与（engagement）是学习分析最核心也最含糊的概念。它至少有三个维度：行为参与（来不来、做不做）、认知参与（想得深不深）、情感参与（愿不愿意）。日志最容易捕捉行为维度，于是它常被默认为「参与度」，但要记得这只是冰山一角。</p>\n<p>常用的行为参与指标包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>活跃天数</strong>：统计窗口内有交互的天数，最稳健的投入代理。</li>\n<li><strong>任务完成率</strong>：完成数除以布置数，对「跟不跟得上进度」敏感。</li>\n<li><strong>资源覆盖率</strong>：访问过的学习资源占总资源的比例。</li>\n<li><strong>登录规律性</strong>：用登录时间的离散程度衡量学习节奏，常用熵或变异系数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>把规律性形式化，若一周内各天的学习时长占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>7</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1, \\dots, p_7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则节奏熵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>7</mn></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = -\\sum_{i=1}^{7} p_i \\log p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0788em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8011em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 越高代表越分散均匀，越低代表越临时抱佛脚。研究反复表明，规律性往往比总时长更能预测成绩——「每天学一小时」胜过「考前熬一整夜」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"表现指标-度量-学得怎么样\">表现指标：度量「学得怎么样」</h2><p>参与回答「投入了多少」，表现回答「产出了什么」。表现指标直接关联学习成果，因而离「学会了没有」更近，但也更滞后、更稀疏。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正确率</td>\n<td>答对数 / 作答数</td>\n<td>直观、可比</td>\n<td>受题目难度干扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次通过率</td>\n<td>一次答对的比例</td>\n<td>反映真实掌握</td>\n<td>对反复试错惩罚过重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掌握度估计</td>\n<td>模型推断的知识点概率</td>\n<td>细粒度、可干预</td>\n<td>依赖模型假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进步速度</td>\n<td>单位时间掌握度增量</td>\n<td>反映学习效率</td>\n<td>对噪声敏感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>正确率看似简单却暗藏玄机：在一套自适应系统里，正确率高可能意味着「学得好」，也可能意味着「题目太简单」。这正是 <a href=\"../methods/knowledge-tracing\">知识追踪模型</a> 要解决的——把「作答对错」还原成「知识掌握概率」，剥离题目难度的干扰。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合成指标-加权聚合及其代价\">合成指标：加权聚合及其代价</h2><p>单一指标各有盲区，于是实践中常把多个指标加权合成一个总分，方便排序与预警。最朴素的形式是线性加权：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>μ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = \\sum_{k=1}^{n} w_k \\cdot \\tilde{m}_k, \\qquad \\tilde{m}_k = \\frac{m_k - \\mu_k}{\\sigma_k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>m</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{m}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8179em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是标准化后的第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个指标，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是权重。合成带来便利，也带来三重代价。其一，<strong>权重即价值判断</strong>——把作业权重调高，就是在宣布「按时交作业比看视频更重要」，这往往是隐性的、未经讨论的。其二，<strong>可比性幻觉</strong>——两个相同总分的学生，内部构成可能截然不同（一个全靠登录刷分，一个真在做题），合成把这种差异抹平了。其三，<strong>可优化即可作弊</strong>——一旦学生察觉总分如何计算，行为会向得分项漂移而非向学习漂移，这是 <a href=\"../practice/validity-pitfalls\">有效性与陷阱</a> 里古德哈特定律的典型现场。</p>\n<p>因此一条实务准则是：合成指标可以用于排序与触发，但触发后的诊断必须回到分项，绝不能只看总分就下结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标设计的四条戒律\">指标设计的四条戒律</h2><p>把上面的教训凝成可操作的戒律。<strong>戒孤立</strong>：任何单一指标都有盲区，参与与表现要配对看——高参与低表现是「努力但低效」，低参与高表现是「聪明但脱节」，两种都需要不同干预。<strong>戒滞后</strong>：尽量选能早期反应的过程指标，期末成绩这类结果指标做验证而非预警。<strong>戒黑箱</strong>：指标定义要让师生看得懂，否则仪表盘上的数字无法转化为信任与行动。<strong>戒静态</strong>：随着课程推进，同一指标的含义会漂移（第一周的「低活跃」和第十周的「低活跃」风险等级不同），指标需要随情境校准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指标工程是把原始事件逐级提炼为可决策信号的管道，是学习分析最易出错的第一关。</li>\n<li>参与指标度量「投入多少」，规律性常比总时长更有预测力；表现指标度量「学得怎样」，但更滞后稀疏。</li>\n<li>合成加权指标便于排序，却隐藏了价值判断、抹平了内部差异、并可能诱发指标作弊，触发后必须回到分项诊断。</li>\n<li>指标设计要守四戒：戒孤立、戒滞后、戒黑箱、戒静态。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>把对错还原成知识概率：<a href=\"knowledge-tracing\">知识追踪模型</a></li>\n<li>用算法从指标里发现模式：<a href=\"educational-data-mining\">教育数据挖掘</a></li>\n<li>指标定义不当如何毁掉分析：<a href=\"../practice/validity-pitfalls\">有效性与陷阱</a></li>\n<li>跨库：参与指标常服务于专注与时间管理工具，参见数字学习工具 hub 的 <a href=\"../../digital-learning-tools/productivity-tools/time-tracking\">时间追踪</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"参与与表现指标","id":"参与与表现指标"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从原始事件到可行动指标的三级提炼","id":"核心概念-从原始事件到可行动指标的三级提炼"},{"level":2,"text":"参与指标：度量「投入了多少」","id":"参与指标-度量-投入了多少"},{"level":2,"text":"表现指标：度量「学得怎么样」","id":"表现指标-度量-学得怎么样"},{"level":2,"text":"合成指标：加权聚合及其代价","id":"合成指标-加权聚合及其代价"},{"level":2,"text":"指标设计的四条戒律","id":"指标设计的四条戒律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"描述到规约四层","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-analytics/foundations/levels-of-analytics"},"next":{"title":"教育数据挖掘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/learning/learning-analytics/methods/educational-data-mining"}}